    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/503dfcc27645adf513d183b8a6d2b2d0.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you make it to the end of the cave with limited actions in this puzzle platformer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/f783b832b3111c57d7786077f0c48702.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/f783b832b3111c57d7786077f0c48702.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/f783b832b3111c57d7786077f0c48702.mp4?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/7354b610d485e7d4392a7f974938857b.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/349c750e2e75ec0836d959e42b74c6fb.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a thrilling journey into the depths of an underground dungeon in Super Cave Boy! <strong>Prepare to test your wits, agility, and problem-solving skills as you navigate through a series of meticulously crafted one-screen puzzle stages.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use actions like hookshots, explosives, pickaxes and much more to reach the very end of the cave. The game focuses on gameplay and clever puzzles for a challenging experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/6555a35132676b82b8e038a9cea8caf1.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super Cave Boy focusses on 2d platforming mechanics but with a catch. You may only use a limited set of actions in every stage. For example one stage might only allow you to use 3 x Jumps and 2 x Pickaxe attacks and nothing else. Another might allow you to use 2 x climbing and 1 x picking objects. You will end up observing the stage and finding a way to use your tools in a creative way since they are very flexible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/858d8f7e3cd95f9b69d6d1e40f26de08.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Edge Hopping</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/309e9514d1319cd68c73fed4c8e41c1b.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/309e9514d1319cd68c73fed4c8e41c1b.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/309e9514d1319cd68c73fed4c8e41c1b.mp4?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Coyote Jump</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/051749ddc8df48d5e90f41f0ed994533.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/051749ddc8df48d5e90f41f0ed994533.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/051749ddc8df48d5e90f41f0ed994533.mp4?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wall-over-hopping</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/03ef426b05566fd5301d495e98a7297d.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/03ef426b05566fd5301d495e98a7297d.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/03ef426b05566fd5301d495e98a7297d.mp4?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Double Edge Jump</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/8b3450be5c0c2e8574074b1a01da1899.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/8b3450be5c0c2e8574074b1a01da1899.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/8b3450be5c0c2e8574074b1a01da1899.mp4?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/2d4dd1f5709fc2deb87923d6756488dd.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a thrilling journey through 75 stages of increasing difficulty. Each level presents new challenges, from intricate puzzles to intense platforming. Can you conquer them all and reach the end? Test your skills and determination in this ultimate adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/4d9b9a806427b1b5bdc367554b6e10e3.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/4d9b9a806427b1b5bdc367554b6e10e3.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/4d9b9a806427b1b5bdc367554b6e10e3.mp4?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/e3d853da32c6a5d20e2c454334f706b5.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each boss battle is a thrilling showdown, requiring you to use every skill you learned throughout the game to your advantage. From slimey kings to gazing eyes, every encounter demands your full attention and strategic prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/60071a96e704ceb78be518eab8d45ab5.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/60071a96e704ceb78be518eab8d45ab5.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/60071a96e704ceb78be518eab8d45ab5.mp4?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/503dfcc27645adf513d183b8a6d2b2d0.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you make it to the end of the cave with limited actions in this puzzle platformer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/f783b832b3111c57d7786077f0c48702.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/f783b832b3111c57d7786077f0c48702.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/f783b832b3111c57d7786077f0c48702.mp4?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/7354b610d485e7d4392a7f974938857b.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/349c750e2e75ec0836d959e42b74c6fb.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a thrilling journey into the depths of an underground dungeon in Super Cave Boy! <strong>Prepare to test your wits, agility, and problem-solving skills as you navigate through a series of meticulously crafted one-screen puzzle stages.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use actions like hookshots, explosives, pickaxes and much more to reach the very end of the cave. The game focuses on gameplay and clever puzzles for a challenging experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/6555a35132676b82b8e038a9cea8caf1.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super Cave Boy focusses on 2d platforming mechanics but with a catch. You may only use a limited set of actions in every stage. For example one stage might only allow you to use 3 x Jumps and 2 x Pickaxe attacks and nothing else. Another might allow you to use 2 x climbing and 1 x picking objects. You will end up observing the stage and finding a way to use your tools in a creative way since they are very flexible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/858d8f7e3cd95f9b69d6d1e40f26de08.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Edge Hopping</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/309e9514d1319cd68c73fed4c8e41c1b.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/309e9514d1319cd68c73fed4c8e41c1b.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/309e9514d1319cd68c73fed4c8e41c1b.mp4?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Coyote Jump</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/051749ddc8df48d5e90f41f0ed994533.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/051749ddc8df48d5e90f41f0ed994533.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/051749ddc8df48d5e90f41f0ed994533.mp4?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wall-over-hopping</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/03ef426b05566fd5301d495e98a7297d.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/03ef426b05566fd5301d495e98a7297d.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/03ef426b05566fd5301d495e98a7297d.mp4?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Double Edge Jump</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/8b3450be5c0c2e8574074b1a01da1899.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/8b3450be5c0c2e8574074b1a01da1899.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/8b3450be5c0c2e8574074b1a01da1899.mp4?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/2d4dd1f5709fc2deb87923d6756488dd.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a thrilling journey through 75 stages of increasing difficulty. Each level presents new challenges, from intricate puzzles to intense platforming. Can you conquer them all and reach the end? Test your skills and determination in this ultimate adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/4d9b9a806427b1b5bdc367554b6e10e3.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/4d9b9a806427b1b5bdc367554b6e10e3.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/4d9b9a806427b1b5bdc367554b6e10e3.mp4?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/e3d853da32c6a5d20e2c454334f706b5.avif?t=1731368423\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each boss battle is a thrilling showdown, requiring you to use every skill you learned throughout the game to your advantage. From slimey kings to gazing eyes, every encounter demands your full attention and strategic prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/60071a96e704ceb78be518eab8d45ab5.poster.avif?t=1731368423\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2102440/extras/60071a96e704ceb78be518eab8d45ab5.webm?t=1731368423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=